{"synopsis":"Suatu hari, menara-menara hitam misterius tiba-tiba muncul di seluruh dunia, dan beberapa orang terpilih mulai terbangun.\n\nNamun bagi Bong Ju-Hyuk—seorang pria lemah dan sial yang tak berarti apa-apa—hal itu seharusnya tidak ada hubungannya dengannya.\n\nSetelah hari yang melelahkan di pekerjaan paruh waktunya, dia hampir saja menggigit mie ramen ketika—\n\n\\[Tuan Bong Ju-Hyuk, Telah Awakening.]\n\n“…Eh, sial, apa ini?!”\n\nApakah ini akhirnya kesempatan baginya untuk mengubah hidupnya?","alternative_title":"하남자의 탑 공략법","author":"Kuchikuchi, Pyopyo","artist":"Plan A","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"79723d2a-4e6c-4e73-a71d-7bc74b4ad287","number":"40","chapter":"40","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5956702-dfb4-475b-8689-ebc84d8b8fa9/chapter_ch_40/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5956702-dfb4-475b-8689-ebc84d8b8fa9/chapter_ch_40/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5956702-dfb4-475b-8689-ebc84d8b8fa9/chapter_ch_40/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5956702-dfb4-475b-8689-ebc84d8b8fa9/chapter_ch_40/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5956702-dfb4-475b-8689-ebc84d8b8fa9/chapter_ch_40/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5956702-dfb4-475b-8689-ebc84d8b8fa9/chapter_ch_40/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5956702-dfb4-475b-8689-ebc84d8b8fa9/chapter_ch_40/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5956702-dfb4-475b-8689-ebc84d8b8fa9/chapter_ch_40/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5956702-dfb4-475b-8689-ebc84d8b8fa9/chapter_ch_40/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5956702-dfb4-475b-8689-ebc84d8b8fa9/chapter_ch_40/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5956702-dfb4-475b-8689-ebc84d8b8fa9/chapter_ch_40/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5956702-dfb4-475b-8689-ebc84d8b8fa9/chapter_ch_40/12.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"385e07b4-acc6-43ba-ae9c-e8cda2ae3036","number":"39","ch